{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n\n<p>發佈時間：18:51 2026-06-05 HKT</p>\n<img alt=\"方嘉柏（右二）\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ur/sthl_square/51a6a6e1e073c1ff8ab99a8fe809d18f/2026-06/178065560210428.jpg\"/>\n<p>JOT2026 高球賽今日在深圳舉行，結果由方嘉柏獲得總冠軍，賽後獲頒獎座及名錶，想不到方仔除練馬出色之外，打高球亦有一手。</p>\n<p>除方嘉柏外，亦有多位騎練獲獎，包括告東尼、甘敏斯、霍宏聲、黎昭昇、蘇偉賢等；女子組方面，馬販David price太太Jenny獲總冠軍，而潘頓太太Nicole亦獲獎。</p>\n<p>另外，下周三是班德禮生日，眾人趁機會與他預祝生日，場面熱鬧。</p>\n<p>此外，席間亦有替早前取得在港第2,000W的潘頓慶祝，另有替馬販David Price取得在港第1,000W慶祝。而幾位華將黃智弘、潘明輝、周俊樂及鍾易禮亦有到場。</p>\n<h2>按下圖睇更多相片：</h2>\n<img alt=\"潘頓（右）\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/70b36b499a0721f969b9780c616ee593/2026-06/178065583351051.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"蛋糕相當別緻\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/8ba5640507fc234e4453ca3bad3ca3f4/2026-06/178065587410959.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"方嘉柏祝捷\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/1ebb242af50b208a1bba79cf1da62bdc/2026-06/178065587435411.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"班德禮預祝生日。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/da1dbdbca21980336477878bcc1d92a2/2026-06/178065587433802.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"潘頓太太Nicole（右二）\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/b9ccb522adb1c506889ecd3bcd2ffd81/2026-06/Nicole__0.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"David price太太Jenny（右二）\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/5d26620d03dcd811b6714b98a02814e1/2026-06/David_price_Jenny__1.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"黎昭昇（右二）\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/624c470229c32c22704c610a0c09c45b/2026-06/178065616216239.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"霍宏聲（右二）\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/e01d8f976e4ebc0ef2ff09224fe7243a/2026-06/178065616271971.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"甘敏斯（左二）\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/fb731b46695b78df071e2c5ad8be1da2/2026-06/178065616225943.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"告東尼（右二）\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/f74e64a5bf2af041781ec8a5acfef6e9/2026-06/178065616224908.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"（前排左起）黃智弘、潘明輝、周俊樂；（後右一）鍾易禮到場支持\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/817e754ecfe45d0582b55ce02674a27b/2026-06/178065666581767.jpg\"/>\n<p>陳嘉甜<br/> </p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-06-05T11:09:49.615404+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":301,"images":12,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none"}}